# Akasha official publisher public key (base64 Ed25519) — the embedded trust root.
# Empty until provisioned. One-time ceremony to make the shipped bundle
# hands-off-trusted:
#   1. akasha keygen --out official        # you keep official.key secret (CI signing secret)
#   2. paste official.pub's contents as the single non-comment line below
#   3. scripts/sign-bundle.sh official.key # signs daemon/templates/*.yaml
#   4. commit official.pub + the *.yaml.sig files
# The daemon then auto-trusts the shipped bundle by verifying its signatures
# against this key — no per-user approval needed. See docs/PLUGIN_FORMAT.md.
